{"id":"4fb5cfb29c2f255e","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md","title":"无额外归纳的有限逐句层级相对一致","display":"thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency — 无额外归纳的有限逐句层级相对一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency","91-thm-Tarski-hierarchy-consistency","91-thm-hierarchical-consistency"],"display":"thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency — 无额外归纳的有限逐句层级相对一致","depends_on":["[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency</span><span>91-thm-Tarski-hierarchy-consistency</span><span>91-thm-hierarchical-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency — 无额外归纳的有限逐句层级相对一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(B\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B)\\)</span> 表示外部有限证明一致性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_i:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_n=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_i:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TB}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{TB}_i\\)</span> 仅是逐句去引号模式，不另加扩张语言归纳；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HierT}_n(B)=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(B\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{TB}_i)\">\\(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(B)=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(B\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{TB}_i)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(B))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(B))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由经典完备性取 B 模型 M。标准数码代码在每个 PA 模型中互异，所以可以依次将 T_i 在标准数码 ⌜φ⌝ 的值上解释为当前低层模型中 φ 的真假；其余论域元素任选。这使各标准双条件满足，构造有限层模型。\n旧稿对任意一致 B 直接把元层自然数代码集塞进其论域，遗漏数码互异与论域映射。现声明 B⊇PA，且不声称此构造在非标准模型中保持新语言完整归纳。原书带完整归纳的组合 RT 需要另一实际版本的证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 9 的分层动机；有限逐句模式的模型扩张直接证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_n=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_i:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TB}_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HierT}_n(B)=\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(B\\cup\\bigcup_{i<n}\\operatorname{TB}_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchical\\text{-}truth\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(B)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\operatorname{HierT}_n(B))].","display":true}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8f93c57db760a2b7","4e50c115b0d32044"]}